-- `coins is list of 4 sprites`: the list's name says what the sprites are, so each
-- one gets image "coin" (design decisions, Q3) instead of a placeholder.
coins is list of 4 sprites
first is item 1 of coins
to draw
  clear screen to black
  each c in coins
    draw sprite c at c.x, c.y
  write "{first.image}" at 2, 2 in white
run game with update and draw
